-- The intended public surface of the first lattice-store fragment. `joinPut` is the only update;
-- a lawful handler would combine the payload with its current parameter using a join. ADR-0114's
-- current value-shape gate cannot yet express that computed next parameter, so the adjacent probe
-- retains the exact wall instead of presenting this declaration as a runnable implementation.
-- There is deliberately no `cas`, overwrite, or remove operation.
pub effect Store { joinPut : Int -> Int, observe : Int -> Int }
